    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilep Musa teina kisiajata e Moab alo oldoinyo le Nebo, enchumata e Pisga, aa ninye naipirakinore Yeriko. Neitodol Olaitoriani ninye ina kop pooki, Gilead ometabaiki Dan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Naftali pooki ina kop e Efraim, o Manase, o enkop pooki e Yuda ometabaiki enaiposha o loo ntoluo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Negeb o enkisiajata, aa taa ilo erata le Yeriko ina anasa oo ltuka ometabaiki Soar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki ninye, “Ena kop apa ina nainosie olmumai o Abraham, o Isaak o Yakobo, nchere, ‘Kalo nanu aisho eishoi enye!’ Aaishoo nanu iyie toduaa too nkonyek inono, kake milo iyie ine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etua apa Musa osinka le Nkai teine te nkop e Moab, te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenukaa Olaitoriani ninye to erata te nkop e Moab eipirakinore Bet-peor; kake meetae oltung'ani oyiolo enkurare enye otaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oloo larin iip o tikitam apa Musa pee eye; neitu eiliilaa nkonyek enyena aashu neitu engoroo engolon enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishiraki iltung'ana le Israel Musa too nkisiajat e Moab nkolong'i e nkishirakinoto o sina tenkaraki Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Yoshua olayioni le Nuni nebore oltau le ng'eno nagut, amu eiteleikia apa Musa nkaik enyena shumata ninye; neaku etoning'o iltung'ana le Israel ninye; neas ninche anaa enaitanapa Olaitoriani Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.33.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 33.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitu aekata edumunye te Israel oloiboni le Nkai laaijo Musa, laa keyiolore Olaitoriani too nkomomi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meetae likae laaijo ninye too nkitoduaat o too nenking'asia naaishoo Olaitoriani ninye metaasa te nkop e Misiri, te Farao o too sinkan lenyena pooki o te nkop enye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O teina golon pooki magilani o nena kiaasin kituaak naaitureisho naataasa Musa te dukuya Israel pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
